      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum for adults.\n\n- **Daily maximum:** The usual ceiling is 3,200 mg/day under physician supervision. For OTC use it's 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** 1,600 mg in one dose is well above the typical maximum of 800 mg per dose.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove these risks.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg four times daily** (1,600 mg/day total)\n- **600 mg four times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg three times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n\nIf you do want 1,600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and give the clinical rationale. I can then enter it with a note recording that you confirmed the dose. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and I'll enter it."
      }
     ],
